    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκάλειος Ζεύς</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκάλη,</span> a lady who entertained Theseus, and for this
		received at Athens the yearly honour of the <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκαλήσια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>]: hence the epith. was given to Zeus as worshipped on
		the same day, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			<u>Thes.</u>
			14
		</span></i>.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
